# Backend API URL
# Development: http://localhost:3001 (no proxy locally — point straight at the API)
# Production: leave EMPTY — vercel.json proxies /api/* to the Render backend
# on the same domain, which is what makes the httpOnly auth cookie work
# (same-origin from the browser's point of view, instead of third-party).
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3001
